WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.310
I'll kill you, without pity, mercy,

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:06.170
or dignity of any kind.

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.290
Or so I'd like to say...

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:12.280
But I see I have many more toys 
to play with that-a-way.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:17.680
He ran away?!

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.290
No... he didn't.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.510
His real target is...

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:24.380
All the people of the city!

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:27.860
I can't let that happen!

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.160
<i>It's a demon we're dealing with, though...</i>

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.460
<i>I can't make them...</i>

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.010
You guys!

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.500
Stella, you look after 
the townspeople and Nina.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.300
Understood.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:45.480
Good luck to you all.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.190
Wait!

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:49.700
I... I want to...

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:52.600
You can sit this one out.

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:55.490
You don't like fighting, right?

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:57.840
B-But...

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:59.000
Don't worry!

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:01.450
You leave this to us!

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.000
So wait here.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:09.420
Okay.

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:11.260
Let's go!

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:24.810
<b>Beast Tamer</b>

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:47.020
Champion

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:47.020
Champion

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:53.530
They may be weak, but they 
reproduce with such rapidity...

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:57.150
Humans truly are insects—

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.720
Oh? My, my, my...

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:07.160
If it isn't that human and 
his friends from before.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:11.660
You couldn't wait your turn for playtime, eh?

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:14.540
I'm not here to play.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:16.550
I'm here to destroy you!

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:22.320
How interesting. 
Yes, truly interesting.

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:27.010
It certainly sounds like a more amusing 
pastime than stepping on these ants!

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:30.940
You've been wide open for a while!

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:33.240
Come and get it!

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:45.910
You think that little toy can hold me?

00:03:47.550 --> 00:03:49.330
It was enough to distract you.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:50.880
After all...

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:53.420
...our preparations are complete!

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:55.260
Flash Impact!

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:02.430
Did—

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:03.020
Did we do it?

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:05.240
Hey, I was gonna say that!

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:10.850
It won't be quite that easy, I suppose.

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.760
My, my, my. Five on one...

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:17.560
And four of them ultimate species. 
I may be at quite the disadvantage.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:21.020
Perhaps I'll call for a few reinforcements.

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:30.640
They're creepy!

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:32.600
He summoned monsters?

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.500
I sense no trace of intelligence within them.

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:37.820
Now, my charming servants,

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:40.920
feast to your hearts' content!

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:45.430
Dragoon Howling!

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:51.520
My, my. What worthless reinforcements.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.760
We all knew they were cannon fodder.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:55.640
Now it's back down to you!

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:58.560
Perhaps I forgot to mention...

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:03.860
I can call them in limitless abundance!

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:06.320
Then we'll beat your next wave, too!

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:09.410
I applaud your spirit...

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:13.120
but don't go forgetting my own presence here!

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:18.620
Kanade!

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:20.420
How dare you hurt her?!

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.220
Dragon Breath!

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:36.600
You okay, Kanade?

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:38.100
I'm fine.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:42.690
Tania!

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:44.870
Tania!

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:46.900
You okay, Tania?

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:49.400
Y-Yeah!

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:51.610
Thanks... but I'm fine.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.820
Impressive, dragonoid.

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:56.000
That was quite a diverting exchange.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.710
I must find a way to thank you.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:12.350
The city...

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:17.560
Look at how well the insects' nest burns!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.770
You...

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:20.650
Fireball!

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:22.730
Multi-shot!

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:28.000
Human magic simply can't—

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:30.460
Gungnir Twister!

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:34.990
Now!

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:34.990
Now!

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:38.870
Multi-Boost!

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:41.750
Here we go again!

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.500
This is Rein's...

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.380
Finish this, you two.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:47.420
Leave it to us!

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:57.430
Judgment!

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:03.270
This should...

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:05.830
be the end of it!

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:14.320
Even after all that damage dealt...

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:19.910
It pains me to admit it, 
but that strike was truly excellent!

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:25.090
No way...

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.920
He's still got that much power?

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:29.880
Look at all of them!

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:32.030
Yes, very good.

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:36.640
Now, show me more 
of your faces cast in despair!

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:43.710
He ran away?

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:45.190
No... he's...

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.400
He's going to destroy Horizon!

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:49.360
We won't let him!

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:56.220
He blocked it!

00:07:57.200 --> 00:08:00.160
Neither our spells nor attacks 
can reach him now...

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:02.370
It's been a pleasure knowing you.

00:08:02.930 --> 00:08:03.710
Wait!

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:09.180
Wh-What do we do, Rein?!

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:10.880
I want to try something.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.730
Really? We'll help—

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:13.470
But...

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:16.510
While I work it out, the people...

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:18.970
Rein...

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:21.060
You don't know how to help them?

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:24.720
We could yet be of service.

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:25.640
Sora?

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:27.500
Do you mind, Runa?

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:28.150
Sure thing.

00:08:28.430 --> 00:08:32.110
We'll use teleport magic 
to get the people to safety in a snap!

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:35.580
While we do that, you guys beat the demon!

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.240
Rein! If they do that...

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:40.360
Yeah, that would drastically 
reduce the casualties.

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:41.330
But...

00:08:41.740 --> 00:08:43.960
No need to worry 
about our identities being revealed.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:47.210
The people we saved 
in the mansion already know.

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:48.290
Remember?

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:52.250
We wanna protect the city 
just as much as you do!

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:53.740
Sora... Runa...

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:54.510
Go to it!

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:55.690
Sure thing!

00:08:55.690 --> 00:08:57.840
Yes, we will!

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:02.020
Shouldn't we be out there?

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:04.600
I've heard unconfirmed rumors 
that there's a demon out there.

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:07.020
Demons are the Demon King's 
front-line soldiers,

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:09.180
the natural enemy of the Hero's—

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:10.190
No need.

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:12.510
Our enemy is the Demon King alone.

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:13.930
We don't have to face the small fry.

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:14.920
Yeah, right.

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:18.300
The demon stuff could all be crap anyway.

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:20.330
But what if it's true?

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.350
Aggath, Mina...

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:25.660
Are you objecting to my judgment as Hero?

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:28.220
No... of course not.

00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:29.200
Yes.

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:32.820
The judgment of the Hero 
reflects the will of God.

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:38.050
It won't mean anything 
if we destroy it ourselves.

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:43.000
<i>The one-two punch of the instant-death spell 
and the sealed demon...</i>

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:45.430
<i>Not even Rein can survive that!</i>

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:55.040
Yes!

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:57.860
We must continue to secure a route 
for civilian evacuation!

00:09:57.860 --> 00:10:00.460
But there are too many.

00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:02.420
We can't hold out forever!

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:04.430
We just can't handle it—

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:05.690
Remain strong!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:09.670
What will happen to the people 
of Horizon if we fall here?

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:12.280
To protect the city at all costs...

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:14.040
That is our duty as knights!

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:15.130
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:17.770
Stella!

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:19.080
There you are!

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:20.680
What are you two doing here?

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:25.390
We have a request to make 
regarding the evacuation!

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:27.870
I see.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:31.920
To use teleport magic 
to get the citizens to safety?

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:33.610
We'll help, of course.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:35.720
Thank goodness!

00:10:35.720 --> 00:10:39.990
We were uncertain that they 
might take the word of fairies alone.

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:41.410
You heard them.

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:44.170
We'll bring the people here.

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:45.050
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:46.520
Let's go!

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:50.210
You need not worry, Nina.

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:53.370
We will protect you.

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:54.880
Yeah, no worries!

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.270
Rein's on the way!

00:10:59.060 --> 00:11:02.330
Now, let us work hard to prepare!

00:11:00.020 --> 00:11:02.330
<i>But is this really okay?</i>

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:11.340
You're in my way!

00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:13.060
Clear out!

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:17.500
Th-Thank you, Kanade!

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:19.610
You're awesome, dragon lady!

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:21.600
Leave this to us!

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:22.940
Get yourselves to safety!

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:27.550
Damn it... They never stop!

00:11:27.550 --> 00:11:29.870
No, Rein! Save your power!

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:33.460
Crowd control is our job, remember?

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:38.130
This magic circle 
will send you to a safe location!

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:41.020
Those wings... Are they fairies?

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:42.720
Don't they hate humans?

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:45.470
Wouldn't it be dangerous to go inside?

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:47.000
I don't know if it's safe...

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:49.880
There's no way to know where it'll take us.

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:49.520
I knew it.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:50.770
They don't trust us.

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:59.560
You're the ones who ate my hot dogs, right?

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:00.530
How were they?

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:03.530
They were delicious!

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:07.240
Yeah, I never ate somethin' so tasty before!

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:08.940
Is that right?

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:15.040
If they like the same foods, 
humans and fairies can't be that different!

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:16.970
Sis!

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:18.960
You're...

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:20.780
You're both so pretty!

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:22.260
Are you flower spirits?

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:25.760
I knew you were flower spirits!

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:31.220
You saved us, didn't you? Thank you.

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:37.660
Get to it, you two.

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:38.650
Right!

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:40.230
Mana Teleport!

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:45.340
Excellent.

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:47.980
Now, second wave! Enter the magic circle!

00:12:47.980 --> 00:12:49.990
Captain! Emergency!

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:52.950
What is it?

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.430
The monsters!

00:12:54.430 --> 00:12:56.420
The monsters are here!

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:00.810
I will manage the teleportation.

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:01.760
Runa, you—

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.920
Yeah, you got it!

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.720
They're not even that tough...

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:13.380
But there're just too many!

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:19.500
We got this!

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:21.070
Don't worry, cat spirit lady!

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:22.520
Let us...

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:23.280
...handle this!

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:25.240
You guys...

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:30.030
Our way of thanking Miss Tania 
for showing us what's what!

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:31.450
We'll help ya out!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:32.870
You two!

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:35.330
And it's not just us!

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:41.250
As a special request, the Horizon 
Adventurers' Guild will back up Rein's party.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:47.770
They and a few knights are currently 
holding off the monsters attacking the city.

00:13:47.770 --> 00:13:51.970
Though I fear the battle might be difficult 
without the intervention of the Hero's party...

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:55.800
Please, to save the city... and them...

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:57.190
I ask for your help!

00:13:59.930 --> 00:14:02.440
I owe Rein and his comrades a debt.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:06.880
If you're going to help them 
as they risk their lives to save the city,

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:12.160
then feel free to use the darling 
weapons I put my soul into forging!

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:16.010
Leave it to us! We owe them, too!

00:14:16.010 --> 00:14:18.460
We don't need the help of the cowardly Hero!

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:20.520
We can fight our hearts out now!

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:22.950
We'll protect Horizon ourselves!

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:26.010
I see. You're all...

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:29.130
You're going to work it out again, aren't you?

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:29.840
Then...

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:32.790
Just leave these ones to us!

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.480
Well, isn't this interesting?

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:40.480
I've got courage times a hundred... 
No, a thousand!

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:42.420
Thank you, everyone.

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:45.980
We will protect this city.

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:48.780
Raise your swords!

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:50.380
Act as knights!

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:53.180
Mana Teleport!

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:58.170
I won't let you come any closer!

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:00.540
Fireball! Multi-shot!

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:04.180
Now, get into the circle!

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:05.840
Illusion Arrow!

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:06.760
Stay strong!

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:08.580
We must hold them off, 
no matter what it takes!

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:16.220
<i>I'm scared to hurt people, or to get hurt...</i>

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:20.460
<i>That's why I always ran... and endured...</i>

00:15:20.970 --> 00:15:24.170
<i>They're all fighting... but I...</i>

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:28.900
<i>Is it enough to always let others protect me?</i>

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:30.700
Mana Teleport!

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:33.370
Nina, you should get to—

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:35.330
Nina?

00:15:40.070 --> 00:15:41.930
How's it coming, Rein?

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:44.220
It's no use. He's still too far away.

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:45.000
What do you mean?

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:47.840
I need to get right up into his face!

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:53.240
Tania, why don't you transform 
into a dragon and take him there?

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:54.200
Not possible.

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:56.780
That form's not particularly agile.

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:58.390
I'd just be making a target of myself.

00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:02.810
And if I attack from afar, the monsters 
would just block whatever I did, like before.

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:06.240
What about the fairies' teleport magic?

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:08.030
That would likewise be a tricky prospect.

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:12.170
Teleport magic requires numerous 
conditions to be enacted in advance.

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:16.660
Matching its destination to a moving 
opponent would require on-the-fly changes.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:20.620
In other words, "Instant Teleport," 
which Sora and Runa can't cast.

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:24.960
The only one who could handle 
such delicate teleportation would be...

00:16:26.070 --> 00:16:27.210
Rein!

00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:29.340
Nina!

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:32.120
Nina, what are you doing here?

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:37.050
I can't just run away helplessly... 
and let people protect me forever...

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:39.980
I wanna help, too!

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:43.270
Nina...

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:44.730
A demigod!

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:51.360
I've heard demigods have special powers 
that other ultimate species don't!

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:54.490
Something about 
spacial manipulation or something...

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:57.160
Yes. I do believe Nina could cast it...

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:58.280
Instant Teleport!

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.240
Nina...

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:03.550
I want to get close to that demon.

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:04.600
Can you get me there?

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:07.580
I can.

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:12.150
Nina, will you help me?

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:13.940
Yeah.

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:17.000
Rein, Nina, hurry!

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.550
Leave them to us!

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:21.310
But there are too many, even for you two...

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:22.390
No worries!

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:24.800
We believe...

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:28.690
...that our master will do what is needed.

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:33.110
What's this, now?

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:37.500
What does that mere human think 
he can accomplish alone?

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:46.000
Look at him scamper!

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:51.380
Very entertaining.

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:56.540
But can you dodge this one?

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:03.850
Teleport.

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:08.980
Rein!

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:13.730
What?!

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:15.690
We meet again.

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:20.820
H-How?!

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:23.160
Is that... a demigod?!

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:25.800
Of course... Instant Teleport!

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:26.870
Right answer.

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:32.040
And you can chain its use 
to create an effect akin to flight...

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.800
But it'll do you no good!

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.090
A mere human can't harm me!

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:39.090
Boost!

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:41.930
Increasing your own power?

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:45.010
But what good does a mere human 
increasing their power do?

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:50.110
I'll extend my honest compliments 
for making it this close to me...

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:52.170
But now it's the end.

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:54.980
Go on! Devour that human!

00:18:55.360 --> 00:19:00.030
Physical abilities 
aren't the only thing Boost increases!

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:06.290
What have you done?!

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:19.150
Rein! Rein!

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:22.470
Extensions of me, devour him!

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:25.780
Rein!

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:26.780
Rein!

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:27.820
Rein!

00:19:27.820 --> 00:19:28.890
Rein!

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:37.340
Obey me!

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:44.750
Wh-What are you doing?

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:47.200
Hurry and devour that man!

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:47.950
That won't work.

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:52.170
I've overwritten your control 
of these monsters.

00:19:52.510 --> 00:19:53.470
Impossible!

00:19:53.470 --> 00:19:55.840
You stole control from me?

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:59.160
It can't be done... certainly not by a human!

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:00.510
Who are you?!

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:03.000
I'm an unremarkable beast tamer!

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:04.800
Beast tamer?!

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:08.510
How can a mere beast tamer 
take control of my monsters?!

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:10.910
Rein!

00:20:10.910 --> 00:20:11.840
Go!

00:20:11.840 --> 00:20:12.720
Rein!

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:13.450
Rein!

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:15.360
I couldn't have done it on my own,

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.440
but with my comrades by my side...

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:22.600
Die!

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:24.940
I can even beat you!

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:50.100
An unexpected but, perhaps, 
interesting conclusion...

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:53.640
Won't you tell me your name, human?

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:54.810
I will not.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:21:00.420
How uncooperative.

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:04.350
It's over!

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:05.640
Rein...

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:06.600
Nina! Thank you!

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:08.220
If not for you—

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:09.580
I... I can't...

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:14.670
Tania!

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:16.970
You never think things through, do you?

00:21:16.970 --> 00:21:18.000
Rein!

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:19.290
Hey!

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:21.210
Kanade! Everyone!

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:31.820
<i>It wasn't a perfect conclusion.</i>

00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:34.140
<i>I'm sure some people got hurt.</i>

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:38.300
<i>But in the end, we kept them safe!</i>

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:46.380
<i>It's been three days since the attack.</i>

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:49.850
<i>The city's on its way back to life.</i>

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:52.340
<i>Horizon's a strong place.</i>

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:58.070
<i>Stella was officially appointed 
the new captain of the Knights.</i>

00:21:58.510 --> 00:22:02.230
<i>I'm sure she'll remake 
the Knights as a force for good.</i>

00:22:03.860 --> 00:22:07.880
<i>She told me that 
the accomplices to the wrongdoing</i>

00:22:07.880 --> 00:22:10.860
<i>were moved to the capital for punishment.</i>

00:22:11.380 --> 00:22:15.060
<i>Stella also looked into Nina's village.</i>

00:22:15.450 --> 00:22:20.020
<i>Apparently, the villagers 
moved away after losing Nina.</i>

00:22:20.670 --> 00:22:24.560
<i>But as long as she's alive, she'll probably 
run into them again some day.</i>

00:22:27.780 --> 00:22:30.510
<i>Kanade's been a huge help 
in putting the city back together.</i>

00:22:30.510 --> 00:22:32.650
<i>She's a proper Horizonian now!</i>

00:22:34.900 --> 00:22:39.000
<i>Tania had been hiding the fact 
that she was a dragonoid...</i>

00:22:41.400 --> 00:22:44.240
<i>But apparently they'd all 
caught on a while back!</i>

00:22:44.240 --> 00:22:45.550
What?!

00:22:47.740 --> 00:22:51.720
<i>Sora and Runa are fitting in 
really well now, too.</i>

00:22:54.660 --> 00:22:57.290
Hey, girls! Well done!

00:22:57.290 --> 00:22:58.520
Have some fresh from the grill!

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:05.530
Take as many as you want!

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:06.730
Thank you!

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:06.730
Heck yeah!

00:23:06.730 --> 00:23:09.680
You really are the city's champions.

00:23:09.680 --> 00:23:11.610
They really are amazing.

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:13.950
But you're a champion, too!

00:23:14.360 --> 00:23:15.220
Me?

00:23:15.680 --> 00:23:17.410
C'mon, I'm no champion.

00:23:18.180 --> 00:23:21.620
I'm just an ordinary beast tamer, 
the kind you find anywhere!

00:23:21.620 --> 00:23:23.580
I don't know about that...

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:26.090
What? Wh-What's with you guys?

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:28.070
Oh, Rein...

00:23:29.050 --> 00:23:31.020
You're still totally Rein!

00:23:31.020 --> 00:23:33.640
Huh?! What's that mean?

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:40.020
A Home for All

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:39.130
Next Time: "A Home for All."
